-- More reference coordinates for the cities Kondo students study in.
--
-- A continuation of 20260815213000_place_coordinates_backfill, which covered
-- the largest cities and left 300-odd others with no coordinates at all — so
-- Nearby showed no distance for most of the country.
--
-- These are city-centre reference points, which is the precision the feature
-- needs: distances are rounded to whole kilometres, and two students in the
-- same city with no campus coordinates both resolve to the same centroid and
-- correctly read '< 1 km away' rather than a fabricated separation.
--
-- Every value below was checked against the province the row already records
-- before it was written here; anything that fell outside its own province was
-- dropped rather than corrected by guesswork. Prefectures whose transliterated
-- names could not be resolved with confidence keep NULL and show no distance,
-- which is the honest outcome and the one the surface already handles.
--
-- Data, not schema. Each statement touches only rows whose coordinates are
-- still NULL, so re-running is a no-op and a corrected value is never
-- overwritten.

